# Trivy ignore list (read from the repo root by image-scan.yaml).

# DS-0002 "Image user should not be 'root'": Home Assistant add-ons run as
# root by design. The base image's s6-overlay init (/init) needs root, and the
# Supervisor sandboxes the container (AppArmor, no host network, only the
# mapped /config and /data). Not fixable in this repo.
DS-0002
